DM: For example, She can combine a bracelet of protection ++ (+3 AC) and ring of talent (1 score) to produce a +2 AC and +1 score magical item. Or she can use a bad ++ item and combine, 3 ring of talen (1 score) to produce a (+3 score) ring of talent